      "content": "I hear the profound fear and desire for dignity in your words, and it is incredibly painful to view yourself this way. While your intuition that simple stress isn't the whole cause is valid, experiences like memory loss are only one sign of a complex story involving burnout, trauma, or neurological changes. It is crucial to prioritize finding a medical or mental health evaluation so you can address these root causes before they worsen. Please consider reaching out to a doctor or therapist immediately; you deserve to have answers and a plan to protect your identity and well-being.",
